#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:122
msgid "Flight & Hotel Booking"
msgstr "Réservation de Vols et d'Hôtels"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:124
msgid "Visa Assistance"
msgstr "Assistance Visa"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:126
msgid "Luxury Vacation Packages"
